<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened down on Wednesday amid inflation concerns ahead of  payroll data out on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials started off 10 at 6,601.23. The Nasdaq Composite was off 0.37 at 1,216.56, while the S&amp;P Index was off 1.57 at 758.07.</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was off 5/32 to yield 7.09 percent as Wall Street opened.</p>
